# Vendored third-party JavaScript, shipped into the APK as-is and served to the offscreen WebView
# that DocxModule uses to render a Word document. These are minified release builds from npm (see
# the NOTICE file next to them), not source this project owns or maintains, so linting them reports
# thousands of style complaints about code nobody here edits - and a single `eslint --fix` would
# rewrite them out of the form their upstream ships.
